Step 1: Create a Free Ngrok Account

1. Visit: https://dashboard.ngrok.com/signup
2. Sign up for a free account.
3. Verify your email address.

Step 2: Get Your Authentication Token

1. Log in to the Ngrok Dashboard.
2. Navigate to Your Authtoken section.
3. Copy your generated token.

Example:

YOUR_NGROK_TOKEN = "your_ngrok_auth_token"

Step 3: Install Required Packages

!pip install flask pyngrok

Step 4: Configure Ngrok Token

Add the following code before creating the public URL:

from pyngrok import ngrok

ngrok.set_auth_token("YOUR_NGROK_TOKEN")

Step 5: Run the Application

When the application starts, a public URL will be generated automatically:

https://abcd1234.ngrok-free.app

Open the generated URL in your browser to access the chatbot from anywhere.

Example

from pyngrok import ngrok

ngrok.set_auth_token("YOUR_NGROK_TOKEN")

public_url = ngrok.connect(5000)

print("Open this URL:")
print(public_url)

